<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed higher in active trading.</p>
<p>The Amex index closed at 588.66, up 0.99.</p>
<p>Winners beat losers 273 to 224.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose two cents.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 19,939,810 compared with 18,993,945 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>	  (Prices official as of 1645 EST/2145 GMT)</p>
</text>
